    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Hassan Anwar",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107305736208779468288/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVN2dklAViqozP2Zg3gmGJW8zTBREEi20BDxA7IQwPQd3dwphnQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I had a great experience at Desi Mandi in Vaudreuil-Dorion! The store is clean, well-organized, and has an impressive selection of South Asian groceries—from fresh produce and spices to snacks, flours, and frozen items. I was able to find everything I needed in one place.\nThe staff is very welcoming and helpful, and they genuinely care about customer satisfaction. Prices are reasonable, and they carry many authentic brands that are hard to find elsewhere in the area.\nOverall, it’s a wonderful addition to the community. Highly recommended for anyone looking for quality Indian/Pakistani groceries!\n\nTop of it it does have alot of canadain products as well. Don't need to go any where else.",
        "time": 1763915514,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Shamir A",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102599558082233980042/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJICRpB3d6zUBi6hKiSmE9yI-sZk1wxLWGPOeenvrHpPL-pda2z=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Fresh meat, clean store. Chaat and snacks inside as well.",
        "time": 1765127725,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Francesco Balassone",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109270325377722946340/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ8DRDuYv0NSViUJM5_r9S8VTC0uZ2_LKJ41dEb3ygROGjQrA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Very nice staff, great selection of imported goods from a variety of places. They even gave free samples of the food, which was extremely appreciated even though they didn't have to! The prices were also very affordable. Would come by more often if I lived in the area.",
        "time": 1762631282,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jay Patel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112172862548642932546/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIIh-ag0JMZnXti4lGyHBUA8spPwp8uu1yvP0s-IDyLawQ67g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Very friendly staff and clean inside. I always used to go to the park ex location since I moved to vaudreuil i decided to try their pre marinated chicken. It tasted very good. I had a nice talk with the staff there and he even prepared me a salad for free since it was my first time there. Very accommodating staff! Highly recommend",
        "time": 1761066961,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Amanpreet Singh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102815390868378609653/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUYIJpu1sXsCDuUfGqPLt8EeAatlg1Ob-znHC7TO1rcEC6cSkGz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "I find the items they have is overpriced comparatively walmart and the apna punjab grocery store on Harwood street.\nI bought canola oil for $18 while the same one I found for just $8 in walmart later.",
